  <description>
    <p>Katachi is a native design tool with Figma's workflow: the same canvas behavior, selection rules, tools, panels, and keyboard shortcuts. It runs offline and keeps your files on your disk.</p>
    <p>It has auto layout, components and variants, variables with modes, vector editing, prototyping with smart animate, Dev Mode code, real-time multiplayer, Figma plugin support, an MCP server for AI agents, and it opens Figma .fig files.</p>
  </description>
